    "objectives": "Aim: replace drawing-based fire plan review with model-based checking during design development.",
    "aimAndScope": "Aim: replace drawing-based fire plan review with model-based checking during design development.",
    "benefits": "Earlier detection of fire safety non-compliance; fewer permit resubmissions.",
    "limitations": "Travel distance requires a computed egress path, which not all authoring tools export.",
